post_install() {
  cat <<'MSG'
==> duckwm runs /etc/duckwm/config.lua until you have ~/.config/duckwm/config.lua.
    To start one of your own from it:
      mkdir -p ~/.config/duckwm && cp /etc/duckwm/config.lua ~/.config/duckwm/
==> For completion and docs in your editor (lua-language-server):
      cp /usr/share/duckwm/luarc.json ~/.config/duckwm/.luarc.json
    It points at /usr/share/duckwm/meta, so upgrades keep it current.
==> Guide and API reference: /usr/share/doc/duckwm
MSG
}
